OL,3,ATrump says he was 'kidding' about Dana
OL,4,AWhite press secretary offer
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has said he
OL,7,F"was kidding" about asking Ultimate
OL,8,FFighting Championship (UFC) boss Dana
OL,9,FWhite to be the White House press
OL,10,Fsecretary.
OL,12,FTrump told the media on Sunday that
OL,13,FWhite "loves the idea" but that the
OL,14,Finvitation was "just a little fun".
OL,16,FIt comes after the president posted on
OL,17,Fhis Truth Social platform on Saturday
OL,18,Fthat he had offered White the role,
OL,19,Fasking him to take it while writing,
OL,20,F"Dana will be a Press Secretary like
OL,21,Fnone other."
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
